{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2016-05", "window": 2, "start_date": 1462665600, "end_date": 1463356799, "month_true_total": 50, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 17:52:12 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "23011240", "author": {"steamid": "76561198099678337", "personaname": "The Muffin Man", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198099678337/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 117, "playtime_forever": 1201, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 469, "last_played": 1721580889, "avatar": "6330c0531c83e7262767b52a29728f6801bcc289"}, "language": "english", "review": "Yeah ngl even to this day it still holds up pretty well. Art style is good. Combat feels nice. It's funny seeing some really old mechanics like the \"spartan rage\" mechanic from GoW is in this. Game is really really fun. Play it.", "timestamp_created": 1463356726, "timestamp_updated": 1720988019, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.529085874557495117", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "22997316", "author": {"steamid": "76561198017983974", "personaname": "Duuyte", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198017983974/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 514, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 514, "last_played": 1463473536, "avatar": "95210ebde9f6b85d74fae65beac492c3a33ca5ef"}, "language": "english", "review": "Shoot orks hack orks kick orks blow orks. great value for orks looking to learn how not to ♥♥♥♥ around with a space marine.", "timestamp_created": 1463310867, "timestamp_updated": 1463310867, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "22984904", "author": {"steamid": "76561197973986228", "personaname": "BusDriver", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/busdriver/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 4464, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2686, "last_played": 1463256282, "avatar": "763db5a07cee52ed856815a61badede4f57709a3"}, "language": "english", "review": "As a longtime WH40K player, and FPS enthusiast, this game remains one of my personal favorite WH40K-oriented experiences.  I would have loved to see more stories from this franchise, and other race perspectives.  Sadly, the multiplayer community is deceased due to all of the game's age, hobbyist focus, and many other FPS options available.  \nI still play this game from time to time for the solo story, and the occasional Exterminatus if other players are on.  \nThe Space Marine vibe and visuals are gorgeous, and the game remains one of my top 25 all-time favs.", "timestamp_created": 1463257848, "timestamp_updated": 1463257848, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "22967458", "author": {"steamid": "76561198002524847", "personaname": "Vampire Detective", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198002524847/", "num_games_owned": 254, "num_reviews": 81, "playtime_forever": 1091, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 981, "last_played": 1524720368, "avatar": "35c45d06bbb32415800ac8b